# VideoRTC - WebRTC Video Call Application

Simple peer-to-peer video calling application built with **React**, **TypeScript**, **Janus Gateway**, and **WebRTC**.

## 🚀 Features

- 📹 Real-time video calling
- 🎤 Audio/Video controls
- 🔒 Secure HTTPS connections
- 🐳 Docker-based deployment
- 🎨 Modern, responsive UI
- ♿ Accessible controls

## 🏗️ Architecture

### Tech Stack

- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite
- **WebRTC Gateway**: Janus Gateway (VideoRoom plugin)
- **TURN/STUN**: Coturn server for NAT traversal
- **Reverse Proxy**: NGINX with SSL termination
- **Containerization**: Docker + Docker Compose

### Project Structure

```
videortc/
├── frontend/                 # React frontend application
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/      # React components
│   │   ├── pages/           # Page components
│   │   ├── services/        # Janus & WebRTC services
